			"notes": "The mod has been completely rewritten from a scratch.\nNow it's more stable, more reliable, cooler, more understandable and easy to use.\n\n### Changes and new features\n- Configs are in YAML format now (`.yml`); \n- Using Identifiers (visible with `F3` and `F3 + H`) instead of translation keys;\n- Support for vanilla # tags;\n- Simple and pretty GUI for managing condition configs;\n- Rewritten Wiki as well, including useful examples;\n- Now available for 1.21.1, 1.21.4, 1.21.11 and 26.x\n\n<details>\n<summary>Fixes and minor changes</summary>\n\n- Fixed an issue when the last attacked block was still allowed to be attacked\n  after turning the condition config on;\n- Fixed an issue when picking a block could lead to incorrect held item value\n  for the condition's context (this fix is configurable and opt-out);\n\n</details>"
		}
